## Approach

Introduce `LanguageAdapter` trait and `LanguageRegistry` in a new `src/parser/adapter.rs` module. Wrap existing `rust::parse()` and `dart::parse()` into thin adapter structs. Thread the registry into the pipeline as a new parameter, replacing the hardcoded `extensions_for_language()` + `ext_to_lang` HashMap dispatch. Keep `parse_file()` as a thin delegator to a default registry so the ~20 test-file call sites don't need changes.

A `FcaAttributeSource` marker trait is defined (no methods yet — sutra/35 fills those in). `RustAdapter` implements it so the capability query returns `Some`; `DartAdapter` does not.

